# Card, king stuck: the giant king of hearts (card_king), 3 m wide and 4.2 m tall, thrown so hard it stuck in the board corner
# first: leaning back 25° and over to one side, about a fifth of it buried, its face to +z and up.
format 1
collider mesh

# Half the vertices its size would give it, and its parts half too: big, simple forms, and dozens of game pieces lie on the
# board
Detail detail=0.5
    Translate translation=(0, 1.55, 0)
        Rotate rotation=(-0.44, 0.25, 0.3)
            Part part=card_king
